We are seeking a Senior AI Engineer (Inference) to design, optimize, and scale high-performance AI inference systems in production;
This role focuses on serving large-scale AI models (LLMs, VLMs, Computer Vision models) with high throughput, low latency, and strong reliability.
You will work closely with AI researchers, backend engineers, and platform teams to deliver real-time AI capabilities powering millions of requests;
You are expected to deeply understand model inference optimization, distributed systems, GPU utilization, and production-grade deployment.
1. Inference System Design & Optimization
Design and implement high-performance inference pipelines for LLM/VLM/Computer Vision models;
Optimize latency, throughput, and memory usage (batching, caching, KV cache, quantization);
Deploy and tune inference engines such as: vLLM / Triton Inference Server / SGLang.
2. Distributed & Scalable Serving
Build scalable systems handling to millions of requests;
Implement:
Model sharding / tensor parallelism
Multi-GPU / multi-node inference
Autoscaling strategies (Kubernetes-based)
Optimize GPU utilization on systems like:
NVIDIA DGX A100
3. Production Deployment & Reliability
Build and maintain production APIs (OpenAI-compatible, REST/gRPC);
Integrate observability tools:
Metrics (Prometheus);
Logs (Grafana, VictoriaLogs)
4+ years experience in backend / AI systems;
Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering or a related field;
Strong backend skills (Python) and experience building scalable APIs with streaming and request scheduling;
Hands-on experience with LLM/VLM/Computer Vision inference in production , GPU optimization;
Experience with vLLM / SGLang / Triton Inference Server for building and optimizing high-throughput, low-latency LLM inference systems;
Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure);
Hands-on with databases (e.g., PostgreSQL, Redis, MongoDB) for caching, logging, and real-time data serving in AI systems.

Company Introduction
Momo is one of Vietnam's leading fintech companies, serving more than 30 million users across payments, financial services, and everyday digital needs.
Our ambition is to become an AI-powered Financial Assistant for every Vietnamese.
We use technology and data to make managing money simpler, more accessible, and more relevant, from payments and transfers to borrowing, saving, investing, and daily spending.
We are building an AI-first financial platform that helps more people access personalized and trusted financial services.
AI is increasingly embedded in how we understand users, improve products, manage risk, and protect transactions.
About the Role
Join MoMo's Data Science community to solve product and financial-services problems with statistics, experimentation, and machine learning.
Depending on your strengths, you may work on personalization, growth, risk, fraud, credit, or customer intelligence.
At level I, you will deliver well-scoped analyses and models with guidance.
At level II, you will own larger problem areas, work more independently, and partner with product and engineering teams to move solutions into production.
Recommendation, personalization, and customer growth
Risk, fraud, credit, and customer intelligence
Segmentation, forecasting, experimentation, and product measurement
Why work with us
Build products for more than 30 million users at one of Vietnam's leading fintech companies.
Work on AI and data systems that influence real customer and business outcomes.
Solve complex problems across financial services, personalization, fraud, conversational AI, and large-scale platforms.
Work across the full development lifecycle, from experimentation and engineering to production deployment and continuous improvement.
Frame business questions as clear analytical or machine-learning problems;
Prepare data, engineer features, and build models that are practical for MoMo's products;
Evaluate model quality through sound validation, experiments, and business metrics;
Work with engineers and product teams to deploy, monitor, and improve solutions;
Communicate findings clearly and contribute reusable code, documentation, and methods.
3+ years working experience with 2 years hands-on with ML, or 2+ years with Ph.D. degree;
Good understanding of mathematical foundations of Machine Learning algorithms;
Have practical experience in applying Machine Learning in personalization, credit scoring or user behavior analysis;
A builder. You go the extra mile to bring your prototypes to production;
Strong product ownership. You take a high responsibility for what you build. You keep a high bar for product quality;
Strong collaboration skills. You reach out to help other team members;
Experience with credit scoring or financial service models is a plus.

MoMo is the market leader in mobile payments in Vietnam.
We strive to make all transactions fast, easy and joyful.
We are looking for an experienced AI Engineer to join our growing Big Data & AI team.
At MoMo, we make AI/Machine Learning the core component to almost every part of the product - product recommendation, personalization, conversational AI, eKYC, risk scoring, fraud detection, promotion targeting and financial services.
As a Senior AI Engineer, you will play a leading role in developing our Customer Service Chatbot system, delivering intelligent and seamless support experiences to millions of users.
Design, build, and optimize LLM-powered chatbot systems for customer service at scale;
Develop and implement RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) pipelines, prompt engineering strategies, and agentic workflows for domain-specific performance;
Architect conversation flows, intent handling, and dialogue management systems that handle complex multi-turn interactions;
Build evaluation frameworks and monitoring systems to measure chatbot quality, detect hallucinations, and ensure response accuracy;
Collaborate cross-functionally with product, customer service operations, and engineering teams to continuously improve chatbot capabilities;
Write production-grade code and maintain robust, scalable AI systems serving millions of users;
Stay current with LLM advancements and evaluate new models, techniques, and tools for potential adoption.
5+ years of experience as an AI Engineer, with at least 2 years focused on LLM applications or conversational AI systems;
Deep understanding of LLM architectures, capabilities, and limitations (GPT, Claude, LLaMA, etc.);
Experience building chatbot or virtual assistant systems, particularly for customer service use cases;
Fintech domain experience is a strong plus;
Proficiency in RAG systems, vector databases, embedding models, and prompt engineering techniques;
Strong software engineering skills in Python. Experience with LLM tooling (LangChain, LlamaIndex, etc.);
Experience with system design for high-availability, low-latency services;
Familiarity with evaluation methods for generative AI systems and conversation quality metrics.

MoMo is the market leader in mobile payments in Vietnam.
We strive to make every transaction fast, easy, and safe.
Machine Learning is a core capability across our products, powering fraud detection, risk management, financial services, personalization, and many other experiences that impact millions of users every day.
We are looking for an experienced Machine Learning Engineer to join our Big Data & AI team.
In this role, you will bridge the gap between Machine Learning research and production systems, helping turn models into reliable, scalable, and high-impact products.
Build a large scale and high traffic microservices system;
Design, build, and maintain scalable ML systems that serve real-time and batch predictions at scale;
Develop feature pipelines, feature stores, model serving infrastructure, and data processing frameworks that power ML applications;
Design and implement monitoring solutions to ensure model performance, data quality, system reliability, and business impact;
Optimize ML systems for latency, scalability, availability, and maintainability in production environments;
Contribute to the technical direction of ML infrastructure and platform engineering at MoMo.
Must have
3-5+ years of experience in software engineering, machine learning engineering, or related fields;
Strong software engineering fundamentals, including system design, distributed systems, APIs, testing, observability, and production operations;
Experience building and operating production-grade Machine Learning systems at scale;
Hands-on experience with data processing frameworks, ML pipelines, and model deployment infrastructure;
Solid understanding of Machine Learning concepts and the practical challenges of deploying and maintaining ML models in production;
Proficiency in Python and experience with modern ML and data engineering ecosystems;
Strong ownership mindset with a passion for building reliable, high-quality systems that deliver business impact;
Collaborative and pragmatic approach to working with Data Scientists, Engineers, Product Managers, and other stakeholders;
A builder mentality—you enjoy turning ideas and prototypes into production systems used by millions of users;
Fluently in using AI tools in every daily task.
Nice to have
Experience with MLOps, feature stores, model monitoring, experimentation platforms, or ML platform engineering;
Familiarity with cloud-native technologies, Kubernetes, streaming systems, and large-scale data platforms.

Company Introduction
Momo is one of Vietnam's leading fintech companies, serving more than 30 million users across payments, financial services, and everyday digital needs.
